{"title":"1951 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mr. A owns a home worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/1/1613ad3e96768d7fdf701749b9f38427dd7a5682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$10,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"19\" />.  He sells it to Mr. B at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a576ffde39ce890fff62cf2687e8107ac1885b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> profit based on the worth of the house. Mr. B sells the house back to Mr. A at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a576ffde39ce890fff62cf2687e8107ac1885b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> loss.  Then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/f/56f125ec0e738a1a0cbf849986a9e7a772840b88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{A comes out even} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{A makes \\$1100 on the deal} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{A makes \\$1000 on the deal}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"692\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c75e792540a8137cb800f9f4e82cdfe2ac2c8e83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{A loses \\$900 on the deal} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{A loses \\$1000 on the deal}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"465\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mr. A sells his home to Mr. B for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2524972a6b2bdd306e8060cbd4c283eee00e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 + 0.10) \\cdot \\$10000 = \\$11000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"226\" height=\"20\" />. Then, Mr. B sells it back to Mr. A for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/c/fec66da7ddaa62d5c2f5d727415c0a563d4e0b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1 - 0.10) \\cdot \\$11000 = \\$9900$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"217\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, Mr. A makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302c4e2c62e5eab85b2471590f4e29a0d7262e3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$11000-\\$9900=\\$1100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"194\" height=\"17\" /> on the deal. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME\" title=\"1951 AHSME\">1951 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1951 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1951_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1951 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" c